(fetched 25.10.2026, version string "Micromod Protracker replay 20260303").

Change for the Settlers port: MICROMOD_VBLANK (defined in port/CMakeLists.txt)
makes every Fxx a speed command with the tempo fixed at 125, like the game's
own vertical-blank replayer. See the comment at "Set Speed" in micromod.c.
